    "introduction": "Intertek provides testing, inspection, certification and assurance services to organisations that need to verify products, processes or assets. Customers use its laboratories and technical expertise to assess safety, quality, performance and compliance with standards. Its work spans consumer goods, industrial equipment, supply chains, energy and other markets. Revenue comes from testing assignments, inspections and ongoing service arrangements, with demand often linked to production, trade and regulation. Independent verification can help customers access markets and reduce the risk of product failures. The business depends on technical credibility, laboratory capacity and service responsiveness, while local expertise supports customers operating across different regulatory environments.",
